      "height": 84,
      "help": "This plugin has two modes, bistable (the default) converts momentary\npulses into sustained pulses, i.e one pulse to set the output to 1.0,\nand another pulse to flip it back to -1.0.\n\nMonostable mode is sort of the reverse, any input pulse detected will\ncause an output pulse to be generated, the length of which is set by the\ntrigger time control (out of 1 second max)\n\nFor a better description, google \"flipflop bistable monostable\" :)",
